/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.poster.avif?t=1758628552\" width=780 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.webm?t=1758628552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/extras/bd87dcf00d92ec2a08c743ebc27e62de.mp4?t=1758628552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don the Grim Reaper's cape and find out what it truly means to be Death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can pet the Pig ... <strong>and play as it!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a beautiful world filled with secrets and discover its truly unique landscapes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into <strong>five</strong> challenging dungeons and face their riddles, traps and secrets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From tiny creatures to giant bosses - every battle will challenge you in new ways!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every character you meet will develop and change throughout the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping tale about death and the many ways we choose to deal with it.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wobble Ghost"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386750/f8c53758e46404f30416f5073586cce93b462531/header.jpg?t=1758628552","is_free":false,"linux_req